't done enough there's no  way they can say they've done enough the  scheme they put forward i think where  the chances offering to lend us our own  money and pay it back over five years is  completely unrealistic and doesn't meet  the scale of the challenge just how our  energy is produced and where it comes  from are tricky areas for the government  with spiraling costs families will be  keen for an energy plan  that helps them financially as well  dan white is sky news  in somerset
 

